# Proprietary vendor binaries and firmware images — NEVER commit these.
# See DISCLAIMER.md and docs/ "What is not in this repository".
# NOTE: patterns are anchored with a leading "/" where they name a top-level
# directory, otherwise `firmware/` would also swallow src/m241/firmware/.
*.bin
*.BIN
*.dll
*.DLL
*.exe
*.EXE
*.sys
*.cat
*.zip
*.hex
brom.ini
brom.dll
DA_v3.8.*
HoluxLoggerUtility*
PowerFlash*
/firmware/
/vendor/
/inbox/
/backup/
/backups/

# Local device captures (may contain your coordinates)
captures/
*.log
*.pcap
*.cap
*.nmea
*.dump

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Local analysis scratch
_scratch/
tools/verify/out/
